        "raw": "<p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Hey Everyone,</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">We just wanted to post the link to our newest podcast episode on here because without GTG, we wouldn&#39;t be talking about the content of this episode. So here is the link (<a href=\"http://boardsalivepodcast.wordpress.com/2014/09/21/episode-11-sentinel-tactics-paxtravaganza/\">http://boardsalivepodcast.wordpress.com/2014/09/21/episode-11-sentinel-tactics-paxtravaganza/</a>) to Episode 11 of the Boards Alive Podcast where we review Sentinel Tactics, talk about Galactic Strike Force, and gush profusely about our time at PAX Prime 2014 as members of the GTG team and board gamers in general.</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Thanks again to Paul, Christopher, Adam, Russ, and everyone else we met at PAX Prime 2014</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Also, feel free to subsrcibe or chat with us in any way!</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Thanks,</p><p style=\"font-size: 13px; line-height: 20px;\">Aaron &amp; Quinten</p>",
