      {
        "id": 118421,
        "name": "boxwood",
        "username": "boxwood",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/eb8c5e/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-27T20:50:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I gotta say this may have been one of the better reviews for a gtg product that I’ve watched/heard, you and the guy you do this with have a really good rapport. There aren’t a lot of breaks or moments of dead air. It did drag a bit, I definitely skipped the party where you talked about PAX for the most part. I guess if I could give you advice I would say you should have split your talk about the con and the review into two separate episodes 2 and a half hours is quite a bit of time to devote to something.</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:51:20.646Z",
