        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "I gotta say this may have been one of the better reviews for a gtg product that I've watched/heard, you and the guy you do this with have a really good rapport. There aren't a lot of breaks or moments of dead air. It did drag a bit, I definitely skipped the party where you talked about PAX for the most part. I guess if I could give you advice I would say you should have split your talk about the con and the review into two separate episodes 2 and a half hours is quite a bit of time to devote to something.",
