        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/7feea3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-09-27T21:06:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, it turned into a pretty huge long episode. It was our longest one to date. And we don't mind if you skip stuff or skip to different points in the show. We know everyone has different amounts of time to give to podcasts. So feel free to listen to the parts you are interested in and skipping whatever you aren't that in to.</p><p>Thanks for the positive comments as well. We seem to be hitting our stride at this point and are getting more comfortable in front of the mic. We actually reviewed Sentinels of the Multiverse in our very first episode, if you want to hear our opinion on that too.</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
        "post_type": 1,
