      {
        "id": 118423,
        "name": "Rabit",
        "username": "Rabit",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-10-01T14:51:45.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Boards Alive\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Boards Alive:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks again to Paul, Christopher, Adam, Russ, and everyone else we met at PAX Prime 2014</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'll say, from my perspective, you are <strong><em>very</em> </strong>welcome.</p>\n<p>And thank you (and all the other volunteers who did such a great job for GTG) for taking the time to help promote the games and support the company. You really helped make my job easier and I think there were a lot of folks who fell in love with the games thanks partially to the energy and personality you both provided (along with the other folks).</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I have to say it's really entertaining listening to the podcast, because - now that I've&nbsp;met you two - I can actually see you talking and having the conversation.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/sunglasses.png?v=12\" title=\":sunglasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sunglasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
        "post_number": 10,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:51:20.772Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 0.0,
        "yours": false,
        "topic_id": 11306,
        "topic_slug": "boards-alive-reviews-sentinel-tactics-and-pax-prime-2014",
        "display_username": "Rabit",
        "primary_group_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_name": "playtesters",
        "flair_url": "/uploads/default/original/1X/f46928191dbf93b4d0df24571543f49779579225.png",
        "flair_bg_color": "",
        "flair_color": "",
        "flair_group_id": 41,
        "badges_granted": [],
        "version": 1,
        "can_edit": false,
        "can_delete": false,
        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Boards Alive\"]\n\nThanks again to Paul, Christopher, Adam, Russ, and everyone else we met at PAX Prime 2014\n\n[/quote]\n\nI&#39;ll say, from my perspective, you are <strong><em>very</em> </strong>welcome.\n\nAnd thank you (and all the other volunteers who did such a great job for GTG) for taking the time to help promote the games and support the company. You really helped make my job easier and I think there were a lot of folks who fell in love with the games thanks partially to the energy and personality you both provided (along with the other folks).\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI have to say it&#39;s really entertaining listening to the podcast, because - now that I&#39;ve&nbsp;met you two - I can actually see you talking and having the conversation.  :sunglasses: ",
